{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"啟示錄","commonName":"啟示錄","title":"啟示錄","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"a6e9abf9f2b18b66a3d18f7888eb972005db7cc9695e64c58c95480a09f6f5a7","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":402},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["羔羊與封印的書卷"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["接著，我看見坐在寶座上的那位右手拿著一卷內外寫著字、用七個印封住的書。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["我又看見一位大能天使高聲問道：「誰有資格揭開那七個封印，打開書卷？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["可是，天上、地上、甚至地底下誰都沒有資格開卷閱讀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["我見誰都沒有資格開卷閱讀，便放聲大哭。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["有一位長老對我說：「不要哭！看啊，猶大支派的獅子，大衛的根已經得勝了，祂能揭開那七個封印，打開書卷。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我又看到寶座、四個活物和眾長老之間站著一隻好像是被宰殺過的羔羊。祂有七隻角和七隻眼睛，這些是指被派往普天下的上帝的七靈。"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["羔羊走上前去，從坐在寶座上的那位右手中接過書卷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["祂拿過書卷後，四個活物和二十四位長老就各拿著豎琴和盛滿了香的金香爐，俯伏在羔羊面前。那些香就是眾聖徒的祈禱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["他們唱著一首新歌：",{"text":"「你配拿書卷並揭開封印，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你曾被殺，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"用你的血從各部落、各語言族群、各民族、各國家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"將人買贖回來歸給上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你又使他們成為上帝的國度和祭司，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們要在地上執掌王權。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["我又看見寶座、四個活物和眾長老的周圍有千千萬萬的天使，並聽見他們高聲呼喊："]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["「曾被殺的羔羊配得權柄、財富、智慧、能力、尊貴、榮耀和頌讚！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我又聽到天上、地上、地底下和海洋中一切被造之物同聲說：「願頌讚、尊貴、榮耀和權柄都歸給坐在寶座上的那位和羔羊，直到永永遠遠！」"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["四個活物就說：「阿們！」眾長老也俯伏敬拜。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/REV/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":14}